K} Maximum Frequency}} {\fs44 Maximum Frequency
\par }\pard {\f5 
\par This control the maximum frequency that }{\f5\uldb VFO A}{\v\f5 VFO_A}{\f5  or }{\f5\uldb VFO B}{\v\f5 VFO_B}{\f5  can be tuned to. It can never be higher than 30 MHz.
