\par }\pard {\f5 
\par   The TX DC Antenna Power applies +12 Volts DC bias to the TX antenna port. This bias is ideal for controlling the Transmit / Receive path on external transmit amplifiers.  This bias supply can deliver up to 300 mA. 
\par   Please read the }{\f5\uldb Important Note About DC Antenna Powers}{\v\f5 Important_Note_About_DC_Antenna_Powers}{\f5 
